{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18946","headline":"德宗神武孝文皇帝挽歌二首 一 · 刘禹锡","name":"德宗神武孝文皇帝挽歌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出震清多难，乘时播大钧。\n操弦调六气，挥翰动三辰。\n运偶升天日，哀深率土人。\n瑶池无辙迹，谁见属车尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}